      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The village sits in northeast Monroe County, just south of U.S. 24, near the Buck Creek confluence with Mark Twain Lake.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
